(7006973, 1060329, 94815, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture. I recently learned that some birds protect themselves by sleeping in groups. The outer members sleep with their outer eye opened to watch for preditors, while the inner members can sleep with both eyes. That might explain what is happening here.</td>', 'Terrific capture. I recently learned that some birds protect themselves by sleeping in groups. The outer members sleep with their outer eye opened to watch for preditors, while the inner members can sleep with both eyes. That might explain what is happening here.', '2013-03-26 12:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
