(7010040, 1060221, 158576, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the "dutch angle" here, but there is something incredibly appealing about this, which I can''t put my finger on.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the "dutch angle" here, but there is something incredibly appealing about this, which I can''t put my finger on.', '2013-03-31 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
