(7011216, 1059678, 138630, '<td valign="top">I kind of agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=158576" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">canonshooter</a> but I just loved the majesty of the trees - so very many of them and perfectly matched.  I also admired the exposure and liked very much your perspective with the inclusion of the statue for interest.  Taking it off center made the image less about it and more about the trees.  Gave this a 7</td>', 'I kind of agree with  canonshooter but I just loved the majesty of the trees - so very many of them and perfectly matched.  I also admired the exposure and liked very much your perspective with the inclusion of the statue for interest.  Taking it off center made the image less about it and more about the trees.  Gave this a 7', '2013-04-01 15:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
